msgstr "Traducción de etiquetas"

# 620b32d302854c5a96be42e6b06b7c98
#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:156
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Galette handle several languages, but when you add a new dynamic field, "
#| "there is only one value possible. Galette proposes an interface to "
#| "translate those labels in each available language."
msgid ""
"Galette handles several languages, but some texts are typed by yourself, in "
"one language only: names of dynamic fields, statuses, contribution types, "
"payment types, social networks and documents types, and some preferences "
"such as the slogan or the member card texts. Galette proposes an interface "
"to translate those labels in each available language."
msgstr ""
"Galette gestiona varios idiomas, pero cuando añades un campo dinámico, sólo "
"hay un valor posible. Galette presenta una interfaz para traducir esas "
"etiquetas en cada idioma disponible."

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:158
msgid ""
"A new label is considered as written in the current language of Galette: its "
"translation for this language is filled in, the others are empty. When a "
"translation is empty, the original text is displayed."
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/configuration.rst:160
msgid ""
"Go to **Configuration**, then **Labels translation**, select the label, and "
"type its translation in each language. The **Translate** icon of the "
"statuses, contribution types, payment types and dynamic fields lists, and "
"the **Translate** links of the preferences, open the same form for one label "
"only."
msgstr ""

